    68	          className="rounded-sm text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--github-gray-dark)] focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[var(--github-blue)] focus:ring-offset-2"
    69	        >
    70	          {isIncomplete ? "Earliest public commit found so far" : "First public commit found"}
    71	        </h1>
    72	        {/* A GitHub handle is an unbreakable 40-character token, which overflows the panel at
    73	            a 320px viewport -- the same width 200% zoom produces on a 640px window. */}
    74	        <p className="mt-2 text-sm break-words text-[var(--github-gray-dark)]">
    75	          Earliest indexed public commit for @{lastSearchedUsername} appears in{" "}
    76	          <a
